{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>VoxSafe-Offline Transcription 是一款以私隱為先的錄音及語音轉錄工具，適合律師會談、醫療筆記、保密訪問及私人會議等敏感場合。它支援在裝置上完成轉錄及自動辨識說話者，所有錄音、逐字稿與說話者資料均不會離開裝置，原價 US $9.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>功能特點</h2>\n<p>它會自動辨識及標示不同說話者，所有處理均在裝置上完成。內建 Apple Speech 與 Whisper 引擎，支援背景轉錄、鎖定畫面播放控制、錄音復原、時間標記與筆記、SRT/CSV 匯出、音訊匯入、全文搜尋及 Face ID／Touch ID 保護。轉錄語言包括中文、英文、日文及韓文。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-456-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-457-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-458-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-459-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-460-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-461-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：VoxSafe-Offline Transcription</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T17:19:17.307141+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":356,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}